cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GroundedRAG in your research or product, please cite this repository."
title: "GroundedRAG: 声明级确定性校验的 RAG 可验证交付层"
abstract: >-
  GroundedRAG is a lightweight open-source framework that adds a deterministic,
  claim-level verification gate to RAG pipelines. Every atomic claim is bound to
  traceable evidence or authoritative rules and checked by pure logic (zero LLM
  dependency), producing reproducible PASS / ANNOTATE / REFUSE decisions for
  high-risk vertical domains such as medical, legal and finance.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
license: MIT
